<MakerLayout title="Privacy Policy — PARADOX Makers" description="Privacy policy for PARADOX Makers."><main class="maker-main"><article class="maker-why"><div class="maker-label">PRIVACY</div><h1>Simple by design.</h1><p>PARADOX Makers is built around browser-side generators. For the core generators, the words, names and choices you enter are processed in the browser and are not uploaded to a PARADOX server.</p><h2>Files and generated content</h2><p>The core generators do not require an account or a file upload. Generated results are created locally in your browser. Your browser may store normal local data such as cached assets or a page's own storage.</p><h2>Advertising</h2><p>PARADOX Makers uses Google AdSense after approval to support the free service. Google and its partners may use cookies or similar technologies for advertising, measurement and fraud prevention according to their own policies and the consent choices presented to users where required.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>The site may load fonts, advertising scripts or other ordinary web resources from third parties. Review the applicable provider policies when you use those services.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or corrections, email <a href="mailto:hello@paradox.engineer">hello@paradox.engineer</a>.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>This policy may be updated when the product or advertising configuration changes.</p></article></main></MakerLayout>
